{"name":"A Mirage of a Life-Giving Friend","size":"medium","type":"humanoid","tag":"","alignment":"???","hitDice":"65","armorName":"other","shieldBonus":0,"natArmorBonus":3,"otherArmorDesc":"14","speed":"30","burrowSpeed":"0","climbSpeed":"0","flySpeed":"0","hover":false,"swimSpeed":"0","customHP":true,"customSpeed":false,"hpText":"40","speedDesc":"30 ft.","strPoints":"8","dexPoints":"14","conPoints":"10","intPoints":"18","wisPoints":"16","chaPoints":"12","blindsight":"0","blind":false,"darkvision":"0","tremorsense":"0","truesight":"0","telepathy":0,"cr":"1","customCr":"1 (200 XP)","customProf":2,"isLegendary":false,"legendariesDescription":"The monster can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature's turn. The monster regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn.","isLair":false,"lairDescription":"When fighting inside its lair, the monster can invoke the ambient magic to take lair actions. On initiative count 20 (losing initiative ties), the monster can take one lair action to cause one of the following effects:","lairDescriptionEnd":"The monster can't repeat an effect until they have all been used, and it can't use the same effect two rounds in a row.","isMythic":false,"mythicDescription":"If the monster's mythic trait is active, it can use the options below as legendary actions for 1 hour after using {Some Ability}.","isRegional":false,"regionalDescription":"The region containing the monster's lair is warped by the creature's presence, which creates one or more of the following effects:","regionalDescriptionEnd":"If the monster dies, the first two effects fade over the course of 3d10 days.","properties":[],"abilities":[{"name":"Mirage of Family","desc":"This unit is a mirage of one of the members of the Bleeding Lotus of Treefell. This unit has the same resistances and physical attributes as __Meridia, the Miasmic Blade, but they will act autonomous to him. However, they will move and attack in any way that benefits **Meridia, the Miasmic Blade.**"},{"name":"Lifebearing Miasma","desc":"At the end of every full turn, the Miasma tends to this unit's wounds, healing them for 1d12 HP."}],"actions":[{"name":"Miasmic Life-Giving Breath","desc":"This unit will gather miasma within themselves, as a wave of impure energy washes over the entire field. \nAll units that are not a mirage will have to save a DC 14 WIS save, or take [2d6] necrotic damage. \nAll units that are a mirage will instead heal [WIS 2d8] HP."}],"bonusActions":[{"name":".!! Blooming Winter !!","desc":"This unit casts this spell after two turns holding concentration. \nOn the first turn, this unit gathers a ice-blue energy within her palms as she closes them together, with her eyes closed.\nOn the second turn, the ice-blue energy now radiates around her, as the mana reaches a boiling points. \nIf, on this unit's third turn, no one has broken her concentration, she will cast this spell.\nForcing the ice-blue energy outwards, she afflicts the entire party with a negative energy. \nMiasmic apparitions summon from the ground, as the entire party will be hit with an attack spell.\n(+11) to hit, 40 ft. radius, any # targets.\nBlue miasmic apparitions attempt to drag the party into the ground, dealing [WIS 3d10] bludgeoning as well as [2d8] necrotic damage."}],"reactions":[],"legendaries":[],"mythics":[],"lairs":[],"regionals":[],"sthrows":[],"skills":[],"damagetypes":[{"name":"fire","note":" (Vulnerable)","type":"v"}],"specialdamage":[],"conditions":[],"languages":[{"name":"Deep Speech","speaks":true}],"understandsBut":"","shortName":"","pluralName":"","doubleColumns":true,"separationPoint":2,"damage":[]}